$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM [(1-Hydroxymethyl)propyl][4-(methoxymethoxy)phenyl]carbamic Acid Phenyl
Ester (29a). PhOCOCl (0.19 mL,ca 1.5 mmol) was injected at a fast
dropwise rate into a stirred and cooled (-30 °C, acetone-dry ice)
solution of 29 (301.7 mg, 1.341 mmol) and i-Pr2NEt (0.27 mL, 1.5 mmol) in
CH2Cl2. After 15 min the cold bath was removed and stirring was continued
for an additional 85 min. Saturated aqueous NaHCO3 (20 mL) was added and,
after 30 min, the aqueous phase was extracted twice with CH2Cl2. The
combined organic extracts were dried (MgSO4) and evaporated. Flash
chromatography of the residue over silica gel (2.6 x 26 cm), using
EtOAc-hexane mixtures from 20% to 50% EtOAc, gave 29a (377.2 mg) as an
oil: [(1-Hydroxymethyl)propyl][4-(methoxymethoxy)phenyl]carbamic Acid
Phenyl Ester (29a), yield 81% FTIR (CHCl3 cast) 3478, 2965, 1719, 1593,
1511, 1495 cm-1; 1H NMR (CDCl3, 500 MHz) δ 1.07 (t, J = 7.1 Hz, 3 H),
1.41-1.56 (m, 2 H), 2.65 (br s, 1 H), 3.49 (s, 3 H), 3.50-3.56 (m, 1 H),
3.66-3.74 (m, 1 H), 4.28 (br s, 1 H), 5.18 (s, 2 H), 7.05 (apparent d, J
= 8.9 Hz, 4 H), 7.15 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 1 H), 7.26-7.33 (m, 4 H); 13C NMR
(CDCl3, 125 MHz) δ 11.1 (q), 22.4 (br t), 56.0 (q), 62.8 (d), 63.1 (t),
94.4 (t), 116.4 (d), 121.5 (d), 125.1 (d), 129.0 (d), 130.2 (d), 132.2
(s), 132.2 (s), 151.3 (s), 156.5 (s); exact mass m/z calcd for C19H23NO5
345.15762, found 345.15864.
