$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (2-Hydroxy-1-methylethyl)[4-(methoxymethoxy)phenyl]carbamic Acid Phenyl
Ester (28a). PhOCOCl (0.186 mL, 1.484 mmol) was injected rapidly into a
stirred and cooled (-30 °C) solution of 28 (0.280 g, 1.325 mmol) and
i-Pr2NEt (0.268 mL, 1.484 mmol) in dry CH2Cl2 (6.8 mL). After 30 min, the
cold bath was removed and stirring was continued for 4.5 h. The mixture
was quenched with saturated aqueous NaHCO3 (15 mL) and the aqueous phase
was extracted with CHCl3. The combined organic extracts were dried
(MgSO4) and evaporated. Flash chromatography of the residue over silica
gel (1.8 x 20 cm), using EtOAc-hexane mixtures from 0% to 50% EtOAc, gave
28a (337.0 mg) as a solid:
(2-Hydroxy-1-methylethyl)[4-(methoxymethoxy)phenyl]carbamic Acid Phenyl
Ester (28a), yield 76% mp 94.5-97.5 °C; FTIR (CH2Cl2 cast) 3468, 3044,
2935, 2826, 1720, 1593, 1511, 1400 cm-1; 1H NMR (CDCl3, 500 MHz) δ 1.13
(d, J = 6.9, 3 H), 1.80-2.42 (br s, 1 H), 3.50 (s, 3 H), 3.58 (dd, J =
11.5, 9.4 Hz, 1 H), 3.70 (dd, J = 11.5, 4.1 Hz, 1 H), 4.47-4.62 (br s, 1
H), 5.19 (s, 2 H), 7.07 (apparent d, J = 8.9 Hz, 3.8 H), 7.16 (t, J = 7.4
Hz, 1 H), 7.24 (apparent d, J = 8.9 Hz, 2.1 H), 7.31 (t, J = 7.8 Hz, 2.1
H); 13C NMR (CDCl3, 100 MHz) δ 15.2 (q), 56.0 (d), 56.1 (q), 94.5 (t),
116.5 (d), 121.6 (d), 125.2 (d), 129.1 (d), 130.5 (d), 131.8 (s), 151.4
(s), 155.5 (s), 156.7 (s); exact mass m/z calcd for C18H21NO5 331.14197,
found 331.14236.
